## 3. LuckyLinesV1 (hueyfreemancodes) — the projection/modeling stack

Repo at `/workspace/repos/LuckyLinesV1`. FastAPI + PostgreSQL.

### 3.1 Edge methodology
**Ensemble modeling** (`app/models/projections/`): XGBoost + LightGBM + LSTM stack; each market
has a prop-specific model. README claims MAEs: passing_yards **26.5**, rushing_yards **17.8**,
receiving_yards **18.6** (verify against training logs in `scripts/train_prop_models.py`).

**Feature store** (`app/services/feature_engineering.py`):
- `add_emas` (span=4), `add_lags` (lag=1), `calc_streak` (short/long EMA ratio >1 = hot),
  `calc_velocity` (short−long EMA delta), `add_xfp` (expected fantasy points).
- `add_team_shares` / `add_rz_share` / `add_opp_share` — target-share, red-zone share,
  opportunity share vs. team.
- `add_vegas_implied`, `add_def_features` (opponent dvoa/ypa/turnover proxies),
  `add_game_script_features` (spread interactions), `add_weather_impact`
  (wind-passing-penalty, wind-rushing-boost, temp-extreme, humidity).
- `opponent_defense_features.py`: 4-game rolling **points/yards/sacks/turnovers allowed per
  game** → `opp_def_strength_score`.

**EV engine** (`app/services/ev_calculator.py`): `EV% = WinProb·Profit − LossProb·Wager / Wager`,
with market-specific `STD_DEV_MAP = {pass=35.0, rush=15.0, rec=15.0}` (hardcoded; a tuning
target). Win prob via normal CDF: `z=(line−proj)/std`; Over→`1−norm.cdf(z)`, Under→`norm.cdf(z)`.

**DFS optimization** (`app/optimization/optimizer.py`): **OR-Tools CP-SAT** lineup optimizer —
bool var per player; constraints: salary_cap, roster_size, per-position counts, FLEX
(RB/WR/TE pool math), **QB+WR/TE same-team stacking rules**, per-player **exposure limits**,
**min_diversity** between lineups. Objective: maximize Σ(projected_points×100).
(`app/optimization/simulator.py` does the Monte Carlo payout sim.)

### 3.2 Data pipeline
`app/ingestion/` has `DraftKingsIngestion` (live slates/salaries via DK draftgroups API), a
base class `base.py`, and presumably OddsApi/other sources. DB models in
`app/models/models.py` (`BettingLine`, `Projection`, `Player`, `PlayerSeasonStats`).
Backtest flow: `scripts/backtest_2024.py` iterates weeks 2–18, calls
`ProjectionsService.generate_projections(season, week)`, joins to actuals, reports
`mean_absolute_error`, `r2_score` per market — this is the reproducible backtest harness.

### 3.3 Reusable code
- `feature_engineering.py` static methods (EMA/lag/streak/velocity + vegas + defense + weather + game-script) — bolt onto any projection model.
- `optimizer.py` CP-SAT skeleton (salary cap, roster, FLEX, stacking, exposure) — generic DFS optimizer.
- `ev_calculator.py` normal-CDF win-prob + EV% formula (mirrors nflalgorithm; cross-check the two).
- `opponent_defense_features.py` 4-game rolling-defensive-strength scorer.

